        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-4" value="" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1140" y="40" width="320" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-5" value="" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="827" y="100" width="280" height="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-6" value="开始" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;arcSize=50;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="939.5" y="-10" width="55" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-7" value="输入: 检测点 \(S_i=(x_i, y_i)\), 示向度 \(\theta_i (i=1,\dots,n)\), 误差半宽 \(\delta=1^\circ\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="827" y="40" width="280" height="47.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-8" value="1. 平移并尺度归一化检测点坐标&#xa;令半平面集合 \(H \leftarrow \emptyset\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="847" y="117.5" width="240" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-9" value="2. 循环: \(i = 1, \dots, n\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="882" y="190" width="170" height="51.38" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-10" value="3. 计算 \(\alpha_i^- = \theta_i - \delta, \alpha_i^+ = \theta_i + \delta\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="847" y="310" width="207" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-11" value="4. 将两条方向边界转成两个线性半平面，加入 \(H\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="847" y="370" width="207" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-12" value="6. 令候选交点集 \(Q \leftarrow \emptyset\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="847" y="260" width="149" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-13" value="7. 循环: 每一对不同半平面&#xa;边界 \((H_j, H_k)\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1185" y="70" width="209" height="80.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-14" value="8. 两条边界不平行?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1217" y="170" width="145" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-15" value="9. 求交点 \(q\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1250" y="250" width="79" height="32.75" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-16" value="10. \(q\) 满足 \(H\) 中全部约束?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1254" y="285.5" width="180" height="74.5" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-17" value="11. \(Q \leftarrow Q \cup \{q\}\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1300" y="390" width="128" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-18" value="15. 由 \(H\) 求一个&#xa;可行点 \(G_0\) (若存在)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1155" y="370" width="130" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-19" value="16. \(G_0\) 是否存在?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="975" y="490" width="119" height="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-20" value="17. 返回 &#39;空集&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="894" y="560" width="98" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-21" value="19. \(rec(\Omega_B)\) 是否&#xa;含非零方向?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1014" y="550" width="160" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-22" value="20. 返回 &#39;非空无界凸集&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1180" y="598" width="142" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-23" value="22. 对 \(Q\) 去重，并用 Andrew 单调链构造凸包 \(V=(V_1,\dots,V_m)\)&#xa;23. 按 \(affdim(\Omega_B)\) 标识 &#39;单点 / 线段 / 有界二维凸多边形&#39;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1177.5" y="490" width="193" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-24" value="24. \(m = 1\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1580" y="52.5" width="110" height="35" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-25" value="25. \(D \leftarrow 0\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1512" y="137.5" width="78" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-26" value="27. \(m = 2\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1610" y="122.5" width="110" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-27" value="28. \(D \leftarrow \|V_1 - V_2\|_2\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1559" y="192.5" width="130" height="31" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-28" value="30. 用旋转卡壳推进&#xa;对踵点，得到最远&#xa;顶点对及直径 \(D\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1700" y="162.5" width="121" height="61" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-29" value="33. 枚举全部两点直径圆&#xa;与非共线三点外接圆&#xa;仅保留覆盖全部顶点的候选圆" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1559" y="242.5" width="200" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-30" value="34. 取候选圆中半径最小者，&#xa;得到 \((C^*, R_{min})\)" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1560" y="322.5" width="200" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-31" value="35. \(|R_{min} - D/2| \le \epsilon_{metric}\) ?" style="rhombus;strokeWidth=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1546.5" y="445.5" width="234" height="49" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-32" value="36. 覆盖结论 \(\leftarrow\) “存在&#xa;直径为 \(D\) 的覆盖圆”" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1503" y="512.5" width="149.5" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-33" value="38. 覆盖结论 \(\leftarrow\) “直径为 \(D\) 的圆不能覆盖”" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1671.5" y="512.5" width="149.5" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-34" value="40. 将 \(V, C^*, D, R_{min}\) 映射&#xa;回原始米制坐标并返回" style="whiteSpace=wrap;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1573.5" y="574.5" width="180" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="o9fSKM3bV65_Al8GUseu-35" value="结束" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;arcSize=50;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
